<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>ctxray — {{.SessionID}}</title>
<style>
  :root {
    color-scheme: light dark;
    --bg: #f8fafc;
    --panel: #ffffff;
    --border: #e2e8f0;
    --text: #0f172a;
    --muted: #64748b;
    --accent: #f43f5e;
    --accent-bg: #fff1f2;
    --mono: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, "Cascadia Code", "JetBrains Mono", Consolas, monospace;
    --sans: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
  }
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
    :root {
      --bg: #0b1120;
      --panel: #111827;
      --border: #1f2937;
      --text: #e5e7eb;
      --muted: #94a3b8;
      --accent: #fb7185;
      --accent-bg: #2a1116;
    }
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 32px 20px 64px;
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--text);
    font-family: var(--sans);
    line-height: 1.4;
  }
  main { max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; }
  header { margin-bottom: 28px; }
  header h1 { font-size: 22px; margin: 0 0 4px; font-family: var(--mono); }
  header .sub { color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; font-family: var(--mono); }

  h2 { font-size: 15px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .04em; color: var(--muted); margin: 36px 0 12px; }

  .stats-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(150px, 1fr));
    gap: 10px;
  }
  .stat-card {
    background: var(--panel);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 14px 16px;
  }
  .stat-card .n { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 22px; font-weight: 600; }
  .stat-card .l { color: var(--muted); font-size: 12px; margin-top: 2px; }
  .stat-card.highlight {
    background: var(--accent-bg);
    border-color: var(--accent);
    grid-column: span 2;
  }
  .stat-card.highlight .n { color: var(--accent); font-size: 30px; }

  .panel {
    background: var(--panel);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 16px;
  }

  .timeline svg { width: 100%; height: 140px; display: block; }
  .ctxray-timeline-area { fill: var(--accent); fill-opacity: .12; }
  .ctxray-timeline-line { fill: none; stroke: var(--accent); stroke-width: 2.5; }

  .legend { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px 16px; margin: 14px 0 0; font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); font-family: var(--mono); }
  .legend .dot { width: 9px; height: 9px; border-radius: 2px; display: inline-block; margin-right: 5px; vertical-align: middle; }

  .flame-rows { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 3px; margin-top: 4px; }
  .turn-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 46px 68px 64px 1fr; align-items: center; gap: 8px; font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 11px; }
  .turn-row .idx { color: var(--muted); text-align: right; }
  .turn-row .clock { color: var(--muted); }
  .turn-row .delta { color: var(--muted); text-align: right; }
  .turn-bar { display: flex; height: 18px; border-radius: 3px; overflow: hidden; background: var(--border); }
  .block { position: relative; height: 100%; min-width: 1px; }
  /* A dead block's own background comes from an inline style (its
     source color), so the stripe pattern lives on a separate ::after
     layer instead of the class's background-image — the shorthand
     "background" in the inline style would otherwise reset it to none. */
  .block.dead::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(45deg, rgba(0,0,0,.35) 0 3px, rgba(255,255,255,.4) 3px 6px);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  table.toolcalls { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 13px; }
  table.toolcalls td { padding: 6px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
  table.toolcalls td.n { text-align: right; color: var(--muted); }
  table.toolcalls .dot { width: 9px; height: 9px; border-radius: 2px; display: inline-block; margin-right: 8px; }

  footer { margin-top: 48px; padding-top: 16px; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); color: var(--muted); font-size: 12px; font-family: var(--mono); }
  footer a { color: inherit; }
  .ceiling { margin-top: 8px; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main>
  <header>
    <h1>ctxray</h1>
    <div class="sub">session {{.SessionID}} · {{.Models}} · generated {{.GeneratedAt}}</div>
  </header>

  <section class="stats-grid">
    <div class="stat-card highlight">
      <div class="n">{{.Stats.DeadTokenPct}}</div>
      <div class="l">dead context — {{.Stats.DeadTokens}} tokens across {{.Stats.DeadTokenBlocks}} tool result(s) never referenced again</div>
    </div>
    <div class="stat-card"><div class="n">{{.Stats.TurnCount}}</div><div class="l">turns</div></div>
    <div class="stat-card"><div class="n">{{.Stats.Duration}}</div><div class="l">{{.Stats.StartClock}} → {{.Stats.EndClock}}</div></div>
    <div class="stat-card"><div class="n">{{.Stats.PeakContextTokens}}</div><div class="l">peak context window</div></div>
    <div class="stat-card"><div class="n">{{.Stats.FinalContextTokens}}</div><div class="l">final context window</div></div>
    <div class="stat-card"><div class="n">{{.Stats.TotalContextEntered}}</div><div class="l">total tokens entered over session</div></div>
    <div class="stat-card"><div class="n">{{.Stats.TotalOutputTokens}}</div><div class="l">output tokens ({{.Stats.TotalThinkingTokens}} thinking)</div></div>
  </section>

  <h2>Context window over the session</h2>
  <div class="panel timeline">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 1000 160" preserveAspectRatio="none">{{.TimelineSVG}}</svg>
  </div>

  <h2>Where the tokens came from, turn by turn</h2>
  <div class="panel">
    <div class="flame-rows">
      {{range .Turns}}
      <div class="turn-row">
        <span class="idx">#{{.Index}}</span>
        <span class="clock">{{.Clock}}</span>
        <span class="delta">{{.DeltaLabel}}</span>
        <div class="turn-bar">
          {{range .Blocks}}<span class="block{{if .Dead}} dead{{end}}" style="width:{{printf "%.3f" .WidthPct}}%;background:{{.Color}};" title="{{.Title}}"></span>{{end}}
        </div>
      </div>
      {{end}}
    </div>
    <div class="legend">
      {{range .Legend}}<span><span class="dot" style="background:{{.Color}};"></span>{{.Label}}</span>{{end}}
      <span><span class="dot" style="background:repeating-linear-gradient(45deg,#000 0 2px,#fff 2px 4px);"></span>hatched = flagged dead</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h2>Tool calls</h2>
  <div class="panel">
    <table class="toolcalls">
      {{range .ToolCalls}}<tr><td><span class="dot" style="background:{{.Color}};"></span>{{.Name}}</td><td class="n">{{.Count}}</td></tr>{{end}}
    </table>
  </div>

  <footer>
    <div><strong>Ceiling:</strong> token counts under 1,000 tokens are estimated from character length (≈4 chars/token) and scaled to match what Anthropic actually billed for that turn — they are attribution, not an exact tokenizer. "Dead" means no later assistant turn contained any of the block's distinctive words; a block can matter without being quoted back, so treat the dead-token number as a lead to investigate, not a verdict.</div>
    <div class="ceiling">generated by <a href="https://github.com/Gabriel-Gerhardt/ctxray">ctxray</a></div>
  </footer>
</main>
</body>
</html>
